.TH CF-FORMATS 1 "September 2026" "cf-cli v1.1.2" "Cloudflare CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
cf-formats.1 \- Output formats, color support, and automation scripting for cf
.PP
\fBcf\fR is designed for human terminal readability and script automation alike. Every list, get, and mutation command supports structured multi-format output.
.PP
.PP
.SH 1. SUPPORTED OUTPUT FORMATS
.PP
Pass the \fB--output <format>\fR flag (or set \fBoutput: "<format>"\fR in your default config):
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
# Formatted ASCII table (default)
cf dns list --zone example.com --output table

# Pretty-printed JSON
cf dns list --zone example.com --output json

# Standard comma-separated values
cf dns list --zone example.com --output csv

# Clean YAML
cf dns list --zone example.com --output yaml

# Raw API JSON payload directly from Cloudflare
cf dns list --zone example.com --raw
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SH 2. TERMINAL STYLING & COLOR SUPPORT
.PP
\fBcf\fR conforms strictly to the NO_COLOR (https://no-color.org/) standard.
.PP
.IP \(bu 2
Use \fB--no-color\fR to disable ANSI colors and styling:
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
  cf zones list --no-color
.ft
.fi
.PP
.IP \(bu 2
Setting the environment variable \fBNO_COLOR=1\fR automatically suppresses colors for all invocations:
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
  export NO_COLOR=1
.ft
.fi
.PP
.IP \(bu 2
In non-interactive environments (e.g., cron jobs, CI loggers), colors are automatically omitted.
.PP
.PP
.SH 3. QUIET MODE FOR SHELL SCRIPTS
.PP
When invoking \fBcf\fR from within shell scripts, use \fB--quiet\fR to suppress progress and status outputs:
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf dns create --zone example.com --type A --name api --content 1.2.3.4 --quiet
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
\fI(Note: Errors will still be written to \fBstderr\fR even in \fB--quiet\fR mode).\fR
.PP
.PP
.SH 4. SCRIPTING RECIPES WITH \fBJQ\fR
.PP
Pairing \fBcf\fR's JSON output with \fBjq\fR creates powerful operational one-liners:
.PP
.SS "Extract All Zone IDs and Names"
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf zones list --output json | jq -r '.[] | "\(.id)\t\(.name)"'
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.SS "Find All Stale DNS Records"
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf dns list --zone example.com --output json | jq -r '.[] | select(.type=="CNAME") | .name'
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.SS "Extract Public Worker URLs"
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf workers domains list --output json | jq -r '.[] | "\(.service) -> https://\(.hostname)"'
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.SS "Export CSV to a Spreadsheet File"
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf audit-logs list --output csv > audit_report_$(date +%F).csv
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
